Train leaves 9:10. Travels 84 km at 60 km/h. Time = distance/speed = 84/60 = 1.4 h = 1 h 24 min. Arrive at first stop? 9:10 + 1:24 = 10:34. Stops 12 min -> 10:46. Travels 45 km at 90 km/h = 0.5 h = 30 min. Arrival = 10:46 + 0:30 = 11:16.

